{"seq":1,"slug":"coupon-budget-control","title":"券预算原子扣减与超发防护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/budget-coupon/coupon-budget-control","wordCount":2249,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"券预算原子扣减与超发防护\">券预算原子扣减与超发防护</h1><p>促销系统里唯一不能被&quot;最终一致&quot;糊弄过去的东西是钱。活动预算写着 10 万元，一场大促结束后实际发出去了 13 万元，这就是一次真实的资损事故。而它的成因往往朴素得令人尴尬：<code>SELECT budget_used</code> 然后 <code>UPDATE budget_used = 旧值 + 扣减</code>，在两千个并发实例上跑。本篇讲怎么把预算扣减做成一个<strong>不会超发</strong>的操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;预算&quot;在促销系统里有两个层次，混淆它们会导致&quot;总量没超、但某个人领了一万张&quot;这类问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>计数单位</th>\n<th>典型额度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>活动总预算</strong></td>\n<td>全部用户合计不超过</td>\n<td>金额（元）、张数</td>\n<td>10 万元 / 5 万张</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>单用户上限</strong></td>\n<td>每个用户合计不超过</td>\n<td>张数、金额</td>\n<td>每人 1 张 / 每人 200 元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>单券成本</strong></td>\n<td>每张券最多减多少</td>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td>面额或封顶价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者是<strong>同时</strong>生效的约束，任一条被突破都算超发。所以扣减不是一次判断，而是三次判断全过才扣——这就是为什么朴素的单条 <code>UPDATE</code> 不够，需要按约束的粒度设计扣减。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[领券请求] --&gt; B{人群/资格校验}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| X[拒绝]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[单用户额度检查 原子]&#10;  C --&gt;|超限| X&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D[活动总预算检查并扣减 原子]&#10;  D --&gt;|不足| Y[回滚用户额度]&#10;  D --&gt;|成功| E[生成券实例 状态 UNUSED]&#10;  E --&gt; F[返回券码]&#10;  Y --&gt; X\">graph TD\n  A[领券请求] --&gt; B{人群/资格校验}\n  B --&gt;|否| X[拒绝]\n  B --&gt;|是| C[单用户额度检查 原子]\n  C --&gt;|超限| X\n  C --&gt;|通过| D[活动总预算检查并扣减 原子]\n  D --&gt;|不足| Y[回滚用户额度]\n  D --&gt;|成功| E[生成券实例 状态 UNUSED]\n  E --&gt; F[返回券码]\n  Y --&gt; X</pre><h2 id=\"原子扣减-三种可靠实现\">原子扣减：三种可靠实现</h2><p>预算扣减的本质是一次&quot;检查并更新&quot;（check-and-set），必须原子。可选方案有三，按适用规模排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>数据库条件更新</strong></td>\n<td><code>UPDATE ... SET used = used + ? WHERE used + ? &lt;= total</code></td>\n<td>强一致、实现简单</td>\n<td>单热点行有锁竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Redis Lua 脚本</strong></td>\n<td>单脚本内 <code>GET</code> + 判断 + <code>DECRBY</code></td>\n<td>高吞吐（数万 QPS）</td>\n<td>需与 DB 最终对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>预分片配额</strong></td>\n<td>把总量切成 N 份，各实例领一份本地扣</td>\n<td>完全无竞争</td>\n<td>有浪费（某片剩而另一片光）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据库条件更新是最容易做对的一种，因为它把判断与写在同一条语句里，由数据库保证原子：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE promotion_budget&#10;   SET used_amount = used_amount + :deduct,&#10;       used_count  = used_count  + 1,&#10;       updated_at  = NOW(3)&#10; WHERE promotion_id = :pid&#10;   AND used_amount + :deduct &lt;= total_amount&#10;   AND used_count  + 1       &lt;= total_count;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_budget</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :deduct,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       used_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       updated_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :pid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :deduct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> used_count  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_count;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>受影响行数为 1 才算扣减成功，为 0 则说明预算不足（或活动不存在），直接拒绝。这条语句没有&quot;先查后写&quot;的窗口，天然防并发——<code>UPDATE</code> 返回的正是被真正改动的行数，判断条件与写操作在同一条语句里（来源：MySQL 8.0 官方手册 UPDATE 语句，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/update.html</a> ）。</p>\n<p>但它在<strong>单券秒杀</strong>场景会撞上热点行：10 万人在 1 秒内抢同一张券，全部竞争同一行，数据库锁排队会把 P99 拖到秒级。这时用 Redis Lua：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- KEYS[1] = budget key, ARGV[1] = deduct, ARGV[2] = total, ARGV[3] = cap&#10;local used = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;HGET&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;used&#39;) or &#39;0&#39;)&#10;local total = tonumber(ARGV[2])&#10;local deduct = tonumber(ARGV[1])&#10;if used + deduct &gt; total then&#10;  return 0          -- 预算不足&#10;end&#10;redis.call(&#39;HINCRBY&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;used&#39;, deduct)&#10;return 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1] = budget key, ARGV[1] = deduct, ARGV[2] = total, ARGV[3] = cap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local used = tonumber(redis.call('HGET', KEYS[1], 'used') or '0')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local total = tonumber(ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local deduct = tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if used + deduct > total then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 0          -- 预算不足</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HINCRBY', KEYS[1], 'used', deduct)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Redis 单线程执行 Lua，脚本执行期间没有其他命令插入，&quot;读-判-写&quot;是原子的——Redis 官方明确承诺脚本执行具有原子性：&quot;When running a script or a function, Redis guarantees its atomic execution. The script&#39;s execution blocks all server activities during its entire time, similarly to the semantics of transactions.&quot;（来源：Redis 官方文档 Redis programmability，<a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/programmability/\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/programmability/</a> ）。代价是这个计数只存在内存里，必须有一条持久化路径：Redis 的变化异步同步回数据库（或用一个&quot;内存额度 + 数据库总额度&quot;的双层结构，内存额度是数据库的子集）。</p>\n<p>第三种的<strong>预分片</strong>值得单独说，因为它解决的是&quot;某一个人群包秒抢&quot;这种极端热点。思路是把总量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 份，每个领券实例只在本地计数器上扣减自己那一份，扣光就向中心申请新的一份：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>每次申请的批大小</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>minBatch</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>剩余</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>活跃实例</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{每次申请的批大小} = \\max\\left(\\text{minBatch},\\ \\frac{T_{\\text{剩余}}}{N_{\\text{活跃实例}}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每次申请的批大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minBatch</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">活跃实例</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">剩余</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代价是资源浪费：若某实例领了 1000 份只用掉 10 份，其余 990 份在它手上闲置到过期。所以批大小要动态调整——大促峰值时批大（减少中心请求），平时批小（减少浪费）。这是典型的&quot;用一点浪费换吞吐&quot;的取舍，选它之前先确认热点真的存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单用户限领-独立维度不能省\">单用户限领：独立维度不能省</h2><p>最常见的超发形式不是总量超，而是<strong>一个人领太多</strong>。总量 5 万张、人均 1 张，但张三通过脚本领了 8000 张——总量没超，营销效果却归零。</p>\n<p>单用户限领必须按 <code>(promotionId, userId)</code> 独立计数并原子判定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO user_promotion_quota (promotion_id, user_id, claimed_count)&#10;VALUES (:pid, :uid, 1)&#10;ON CONFLICT (promotion_id, user_id)&#10;DO UPDATE SET claimed_count = user_promotion_quota.claimed_count + 1&#10;  WHERE user_promotion_quota.claimed_count + 1 &lt;= :perUserCap;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_promotion_quota (promotion_id, user_id, claimed_count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (:pid, :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (promotion_id, user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">DO </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claimed_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user_promotion_quota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">claimed_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> user_promotion_quota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">claimed_count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :perUserCap;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 PostgreSQL 的 <code>ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE ... WHERE</code> 写法（等价于 upset 带条件），受影响行数为 0 即表示该用户已达上限。PostgreSQL 官方文档说明：<code>DO UPDATE</code> 尾部可以带 <code>WHERE</code> 条件，&quot;Only rows for which this expression returns <code>true</code> will be updated&quot;，且条件为假时该行不会被更新、<code>RETURNING</code> 也不会返回它（来源：PostgreSQL 官方手册 INSERT 语句，<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-insert.html\">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-insert.html</a> ）。MySQL 可用先 <code>INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE</code> 再检查 <code>ROW_COUNT()</code>——其受影响行数为 1 表示新插入、2 表示更新了已有行、0 表示已有行被设为当前值（来源：MySQL 8.4 官方手册 INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE，<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/insert-on-duplicate.html\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/insert-on-duplicate.html</a> ），或直接用唯一索引 + 计数表。</p>\n<p>注意两个细节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>限领判定与预算扣减的先后顺序</strong>：先扣用户额度，再扣活动预算。原因是一旦活动预算扣完，用户额度需要回滚；而反过来（先扣预算后扣额度）如果额度不足，要回滚预算，代价更大。回滚都必须幂等，见下节。</li>\n<li><strong><code>userId</code> 的边界</strong>：这一点与<a href=\"../performance-safety/promotion-abuse\">羊毛党识别与领券风控</a>直接相关——一个人注册 200 个小号就是 200 个 <code>userId</code>。所以单用户限领只是<strong>第一层</strong>，设备指纹、手机号、支付账号的关联去重是第二层，两层都做才能挡住专业化薅羊毛。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"回滚与对账-扣了但没发出去怎么办\">回滚与对账：扣了但没发出去怎么办</h2><p>扣减成功之后任何一步失败（生成券实例失败、写库超时、响应丢失），都必须把额度还回去。回滚的三个要求：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>幂等</strong>：同一个扣减凭证只能被回滚一次。用账本（ledger）记录每一次 <code>deduct</code> 和 <code>refund</code>，靠唯一凭证号去重，而不是靠&quot;记得有没有回滚过&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>可追溯</strong>：每笔扣减都有一个 <code>entryId</code>，能一路查到它对应哪张券实例、哪个订单。对账时才能解释&quot;这 300 元扣了但没对应任何券&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>最终对齐</strong>：内存计数（Redis）与数据库计数必须有周期性的对齐任务，用<strong>总量重算</strong>而不是增量修补：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT SUM(face_value) FROM coupon_instance&#10; WHERE promotion_id = :pid AND status IN (&#39;UNUSED&#39;,&#39;LOCKED&#39;,&#39;USED&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(face_value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_instance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> promotion_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :pid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNUSED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LOCKED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询的结果应当等于 <code>promotion_budget.used_amount</code>（对金额型预算）或等于 <code>used_count</code>（对张数型）。定时跑它、把差异做成指标，是发现&quot;某次扣减没对应券&quot;的唯一可靠方式。这条对账思路与<a href=\"../performance-safety/promotion-observability\">促销效果归因与预算监控</a>里的预算监控是同一套数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface BudgetLedgerEntry {&#10;  entryId: string; // 幂等键&#10;  promotionId: string;&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  kind: &#39;DEDUCT&#39; | &#39;REFUND&#39;;&#10;  amount: Money;&#10;  ref?: string; // 对应的券实例 id 或订单号&#10;  at: Date;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BudgetLedgerEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entryId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等键</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  promotionId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  kind</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEDUCT'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Money</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对应的券实例 id 或订单号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>账本表是<strong>追加写</strong>（append-only）的，永远不更新历史记录——修正错误靠再追加一条反向记录。这个约束让对账变成一次简单的求和，也让审计不可抵赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"幂等与超发的边界情况\">幂等与超发的边界情况</h2><p>最后列出几个真实踩过的坑，它们都属于&quot;看起来防住了其实没有&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超时重试</td>\n<td>客户端超时重试，两次都扣了</td>\n<td>幂等键（请求级）+ 账本去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分库分表</td>\n<td>用户额度与活动预算在不同库，无法单事务</td>\n<td>两阶段：先预留后确认，用补偿兜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存与 DB 不一致</td>\n<td>Redis 扣了、DB 写失败，计数漂移</td>\n<td>定期总量重算对齐，而非增量修补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动复制</td>\n<td>复制活动时把 <code>used_amount</code> 也复制了</td>\n<td>复制只带定义，计数器一律清零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预算改小</td>\n<td>运营中途把总量从 10 万改成 5 万，而已用 8 万</td>\n<td>拒绝保存，或要求先下架并说明超发量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>倒数第二条特别隐蔽：运营用&quot;复制活动&quot;功能准备双 11 的第二波，如果复制逻辑把上一波的已用金额一起带过去，新活动一开始就显示&quot;预算已用尽&quot;。复制必须只带<strong>定义字段</strong>（<code>benefit</code>、<code>scope</code>、时间窗、<code>stackPolicy</code>），把所有<strong>计数器字段</strong>（<code>used_amount</code>、<code>used_count</code>）重置为 0。这条应写进复制功能的测试用例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预算是三层同时生效的约束：<strong>活动总预算、单用户上限、单券成本</strong>；任一条突破都是超发。</li>\n<li>扣减必须原子：小规模用<strong>数据库条件更新</strong>（判断与写在同一语句），秒杀热点用 <strong>Redis Lua</strong>，极端热点用<strong>预分片配额</strong>（用浪费换吞吐）。</li>\n<li>单用户限领必须按 <code>(promotionId, userId)</code> 独立计数并原子判定，它是第一层；设备/手机号关联去重是第二层，见第四章。</li>\n<li>回滚三要求：幂等（账本 + 凭证号去重）、可追溯（<code>entryId</code> 关联券与订单）、<strong>对账用总量重算而非增量修补</strong>。</li>\n<li>账本表追加写、永不更新历史，修正靠反向记录，让对账退化成一次求和。</li>\n<li>边界情况：超时重试、跨库事务、缓存漂移、<strong>活动复制误带计数器</strong>、预算中途改小——每一条都要有对应的测试用例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"券预算原子扣减与超发防护","id":"券预算原子扣减与超发防护"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原子扣减：三种可靠实现","id":"原子扣减-三种可靠实现"},{"level":2,"text":"单用户限领：独立维度不能省","id":"单用户限领-独立维度不能省"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚与对账：扣了但没发出去怎么办","id":"回滚与对账-扣了但没发出去怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等与超发的边界情况","id":"幂等与超发的边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"算价幂等与下单价一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/pricing-pipeline/idempotent-pricing"},"next":{"title":"高并发秒杀领券（库存化）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/promotion-pricing-engine/budget-coupon/flash-coupon"}}